    "camerawidth": "function camerawidth()\n{\n    return __view_get(e__VW.WView, 0);\n}\n\nenum e__VW\n{\n    XView,\n    YView,\n    WView,\n    HView,\n    Angle,\n    HBorder,\n    VBorder,\n    HSpeed,\n    VSpeed,\n    Object,\n    Visible,\n    XPort,\n    YPort,\n    WPort,\n    HPort,\n    Camera,\n    SurfaceID\n}\n",
